To what do I owe the pleasure?

495
00:30:39.257 --> 00:30:41.593
I was just having a bite to eat, you know?

496
00:30:41.676 --> 00:30:45.555
But as we're here,
I would love to get an official statement

497
00:30:45.639 --> 00:30:47.974
about your early departure
from the Spurs match.

498
00:30:49.726 --> 00:30:50.894
An official statement?

499
00:30:51.811 --> 00:30:53.730
Well, I thought folks knew
I had food poisoning.

500
00:30:54.940 --> 00:30:55.899
Not from here.

501
00:30:58.526 --> 00:31:03.114
Yeah, yeah. They do. But I'd love
a personal quote, if possible.

502
00:31:03.698 --> 00:31:05.784
Okay, well, I had food poisoning.

503
00:31:06.368 --> 00:31:08.203
And because I respect
your readers so much,

504
00:31:08.286 --> 00:31:11.373
I'll leave out all the specific nastiness
that occurred.

505
00:31:11.456 --> 00:31:13.291
-Yeah.
-But I'm fit as a fiddle now.

506
00:31:13.375 --> 00:31:17.546
So you had food poisoning
and you are fit as a fiddle now…

507
00:31:19.756 --> 00:31:21.925
Exactamundo, Dikembe Mutombo.

508
00:31:23.510 --> 00:31:24.928
Love our chats.

509
00:31:26.388 --> 00:31:27.806
Thank you, Mae.

510
00:31:27.889 --> 00:31:29.432
My pleasure, darling.

511
00:31:49.619 --> 00:31:50.870
Shit.

512
00:31:54.291 --> 00:31:55.458
Roy?

513
00:32:03.592 --> 00:32:04.593
Hi.

514
00:32:05.510 --> 00:32:06.553
Hi.

515
00:32:08.763 --> 00:32:09.890
Are you leaving?

516
00:32:10.849 --> 00:32:11.933
What?

517
00:32:12.893 --> 00:32:14.019
No.

518
00:32:24.905 --> 00:32:25.906
Hey, Siri.

519
00:32:26.698 --> 00:32:30.035
Play the "Roy is sorry
for not understanding Keeley" playlist.

520
00:32:33.914 --> 00:32:36.207
I stole those roses
from your neighbor's garden.

521
00:32:36.291 --> 00:32:38.001
Ripped them to shreds.

522
00:32:38.960 --> 00:32:39.920
And that…

523
00:32:41.213 --> 00:32:44.633
that's Phoebe's light,
so I'm gonna have to give that back

524
00:32:44.716 --> 00:32:46.259
or I'm gonna get it in the neck.

525
00:32:49.554 --> 00:32:52.891
And that, that's a foot scrubber
or something.

526
00:32:53.391 --> 00:32:55.936
The woman said it's good
if you've got gross feet.

527
00:32:56.519 --> 00:32:58.855
What? You think I've got gross feet?

528
00:32:58.939 --> 00:33:03.777
Babe, I think you're the cat's pajamas,
but your feet are a fucking state.

529
00:33:07.614 --> 00:33:09.282
But who am I to judge?

530
00:33:09.366 --> 00:33:11.868
I found so much of my hair down the drain,

531
00:33:12.452 --> 00:33:16.831
it looked like a rat had got trapped
and fucking drowned.

532
00:33:26.967 --> 00:33:27.968
Oh, my God.

533
00:33:33.890 --> 00:33:39.646
Now, you are not gonna see or hear me
for at least three hours.

534
00:33:48.655 --> 00:33:49.656
Thank you.

535
00:34:48.840 --> 00:34:51.425
If you ever do anything
to humiliate me again,

536
00:34:51.509 --> 00:34:53.220
I'll make your life a fucking misery.

